        <ArticleTitle>Effects of <i>creatine</i> supplementation on lean mass: a meta-analysis</ArticleTitle>
        <Abstract>
          <AbstractText Label="BACKGROUND">Creatine is widely used by athletes to increase strength and lean body mass during resistance training programs across many sports.</AbstractText>
          <AbstractText Label="RESULTS">Across 35 randomized trials, creatine plus resistance training increased lean mass by 1.4 kg compared with placebo plus training, with no adverse renal outcomes reported in healthy adults.</AbstractText>
        </Abstract>
